      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Tough mare's race. NAINA (1) looks ready to win coming back in grade. She was a surprise winner fresh but has been good since, beaten under a length in a BM78 last time out. Comes back a notch now and will be hard to hold out. ALL BUSINESS (4) comes through the same race as NAINA without much luck in a messy race. The effort two back reads well and she can improve. KIWI JENNI (8) is back slightly in trip but will be strong late, she's still got upside at her seventh start. PREVENTION (7) is still relatively lightly raced as well and turns around quickly here. She'll likely lead and take some running down.",
